      "section": [
        "LCG 参数恢复与预测",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 15,
      "line_end": 15,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/crypto-lcg-recover.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:bb57fd19acab6da15b9cd4f3604dd7a6369091e531afb26e89b5b896015b500d",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "LCG 参数恢复与预测",
      "section": [
        "LCG 参数恢复与预测",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 先由连续差分的 gcd 恢复 m（或题目已给 m）。\n2. 用三组连续值解线性方程求 a,c；模不互素时多取几组。\n3. 输出被截断时，把已知位当作约束，枚举未知低位/高位。\n4. 恢复后预测下一输出，并检查与已知序列一致。",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 19,
      "truncated": false
    },
